    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "It is very easy to see why this part of Galway has remained so sought after despite all the new developments that followed in recent years. Glenard Crescent was built in the mid 60`s when bright spacious living accommodation was not an additional extra. \n\nOne of the many attractions of this large extended four bedroom semi, in addition to its location and potential, is its sun filled West facing back garden that overlooks the beautiful Glenard Park. This is an invaluable recreational amenity on your door step as it is so well maintained by the council together with a very proactive residence committee.\n\nLocated in the centre of Salthill, but away from the hustle and bustle this home is in a mature, beautiful setting close to the Promenade with some of the finest primary and secondary schools, all within walking distance, as is the Tennis Club, GAA Club, Golf Club, Swimming Pool, Beaches, Parks and City Centre. \n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 6.7m (22'0\") x 2.2m (7'3\")\nWith closet under stairs.\n\nSitting Room - 5m (16'5\") x 3.9m (12'10\")\nWith open fireplace and double doors into dining room.\n\nDining Room - 4m (13'1\") x 3.9m (12'10\")\nWith feature open fireplace.\n\nSunroom - 3.9m (12'10\") x 1.7m (5'7\")\nWith tiled floor and views of large sun filled, west facing back garden.\n\nKitchen - 4.8m (15'9\") x 2.7m (8'10\")\nThis is a bright sun filled west facing kitchen with a generous array of built in units.\n\nUtility - 2.8m (9'2\") x 1.3m (4'3\")\nWith guest toilet.\n\nFirst Floor\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.9m (19'4\") x 2.7m (8'10\")\nWith built in wardrobe. Ensuite 2.6m x 1.8m with bath, toilet and wash hand basin.\n\nAttic\nThere is a large attic over this bedroom fitted with Velux window and folding attic stairs.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.3m (10'10\") x 3.4m (11'2\")\nWith built in wardrobe and sink unit.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4m (13'1\") x 3.9m (12'10\")\nWith sink unit.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.8m (12'6\") x 3m (9'10\")\nWith ensuite 2.3m x 1.5m with shower, toilet and wash hand basin.\n\nBathroom - 2m (6'7\") x 1.7m (5'7\")\nTiled and fitted with bath, toilet and wash hand basin.\n\nCloset - 2.4m (7'10\") x 1m (3'3\")\n\nAttic\nThis house has a large attic area that similar houses in the area have converted.\n\nGarden\nThis property sits on an elevated site with sun filled west facing back garden.\n\nArea\nThis house is approximately 157.54 sqm/1,695 sq ft\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Large extended four bedroom semi in Salthill. </li><li> Sun filled, West facing back garden overlooking beautiful large park. </li><li> Both primary & secondary schools within walking distance together with promenade, beaches & parks. </li><li> It is hard to beat this location for the quality of living it provides.</li></ul>"
      },
